{"game": "the-first-descendant", "language": "english", "appid": 2074920, "month": "2024-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1733011200, "end_date": 1733615999, "month_true_total": 1255, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-10-01 15:47:11 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "182198384", "author": {"steamid": "76561198288936965", "personaname": "UmStriker", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/UmStriker/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 349, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 211, "last_played": 1733676734, "avatar": "0d27c4e84a1da2614e476646e9c590e2ae19d3ad"}, "language": "english", "review": "Although the graphics are chopped, the game is fun", "timestamp_created": 1733614947, "timestamp_updated": 1733614947, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182194150", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067484952", "personaname": "OniHildr", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/HildrVT/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 62795, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 39076, "last_played": 1755842109, "avatar": "7514070b6a2d450df1bd1907204c588339c3dc86"}, "language": "english", "review": "An amazing game that reminds me of Warframe.\nWith devs that actually listen to the players", "timestamp_created": 1733611490, "timestamp_updated": 1733611490, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182194002", "author": {"steamid": "76561198318809306", "personaname": "Raziel-Gul", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198318809306/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 5874, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5813, "last_played": 1743121438, "avatar": "309ad46711687f49d3954122d47c1b304245a48c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gave it an honest go and it just did not click for me. Gunplay is meh, abilities are underwhelming, and the goon is really the only thing the game is leaning on to hold it up. Also 3/4 of the co-op player base have no idea how to equip any mods that do not increase dmg. There's a lot of areas and bosses that require certain elemental defense and people do not read that. Instead they treat this as a \"carry me\" game or copy and paste a content creator build that has a fully kited out unit, which the average player does not have as it requires a lot of grind or some wallet opening.\r\n\r\nRNG system is a joke on all levels and the devs keep backpedaling on it. Just designed to have you play more, but the gameplay loop is not enjoyable, fun, or immersive.\r\n\r\n5/10 at it's best and declining. Will say it IS more fun than New World though as of 12/7/24 but I understand they are very different games but judging on how fun the gameplay is engage with.", "timestamp_created": 1733611391, "timestamp_updated": 1733611391, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504587173461914062", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "182192634", "author": {"steamid": "76561199050183450", "personaname": "Axyl", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://ste